  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "草むらに　ひそむ　ポケモンたちが今にも　飛び出してきそうなモノトーンカラーの　こじゃれた　クロス。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "풀숲에 숨어 있는 포켓몬들이 당장이라도 튀어나올 것만 같은 모노톤의 재미있는 테이블보.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "黑白色調的時髦桌巾。藏身在草叢中的寶可夢們似乎隨時都會跳出來。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une nappe monochrome montrant des hautes herbes. Les Pokémon qui y sont cachés semblent prêts à bondir vers vous.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieses schicke Tischtuch in schwarz-weißem Retro-Look zieren Pokémon, die nur darauf zu warten scheinen, aus dem hohen Gras hervorzuspringen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un mantel monocromático con mucho estilo en el que aparecen unos Pokémon acechando desde la hierba alta.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Sembra quasi che i Pokémon nascosti nell’erba alta disegnati su questa stilosa tovaglia monocromatica stiano per balzare fuori da un momento all’altro.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A tablecloth with a fun, trendy black-and-white design featuring Pokémon that seem poised to leap from the tall grass at any moment.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "草むらに　ひそむ　ポケモンたちが今にも　飛び出してきそうなモノトーンカラーの　こじゃれた　クロス。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "黑白配色的精美桌巾。藏身在草丛中的宝可梦感觉随时都会跳出来。",
